  Id: concussive
  DisplayName: Concussive
  RulesText: "The impact of this weapon can leave the target shocked and disorientated.
    \nIf a model is attacked with this weapon as part of a Shoot or Assault action,
    and the attacker rolls more successes than the target, then the target is pinned
    in addition to any damage caused. This includes all models in the cube if it
    is a ranged weapon which targets a cube.\n"
